      "note": "The Hacker News (5 Nov 2026) calls this Docker Hub image also backdoored and identical to tomicdd/artex: the same hidden verifyCaptcha() in the login handler. The article names no tag and no digest. It also names six other namespaces that publish an artex image without calling them backdoored; none of those is listed."
